\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Prospective evaluation on weeks no model or setting had seen: 85 forecast starts, 2024-W11 to 2026-W32. Settings frozen on development data before the new weeks were parsed. Neural arms: mean over 3 seeds, seed range of RMSE in brackets. Bold: best per metric. Pre-registered tests (block bootstrap over forecast starts, Holm over two): P1, SEIR branch vs PAGE{}: $-0.03$ $[-0.41, +0.12]$, $p_{\text  {Holm}}=0.67$; P2, PAGE{}+SEIR vs persistence: $+0.65$ $[-0.99, +1.69]$, $p_{\text  {Holm}}=0.62$.}}{7}{table.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:prospective}{{9}{7}{Prospective evaluation on weeks no model or setting had seen: 85 forecast starts, 2024-W11 to 2026-W32. Settings frozen on development data before the new weeks were parsed. Neural arms: mean over 3 seeds, seed range of RMSE in brackets. Bold: best per metric. Pre-registered tests (block bootstrap over forecast starts, Holm over two): P1, SEIR branch vs \model {}: $-0.03$ $[-0.41, +0.12]$, $p_{\text {Holm}}=0.67$; P2, \model {}+SEIR vs persistence: $+0.65$ $[-0.99, +1.69]$, $p_{\text {Holm}}=0.62$}{table.caption.13}{}}
